{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"const createForm: CreateForm;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/svelte-form/src/createForm.public.ts#L53","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/svelte-form/src/createForm.public.ts:53"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a Svelte form whose instance and lifecycle are owned by the current\ncomponent."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pass an options function. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultValues"},{"type":"text","value":" establish the initial state and\ninferred form value type, while reactive values read by the function update\nthe same form instance when they change."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Call this during component initialization. The form mounts with the\ncomponent and is cleaned up when the component unmounts."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const form = createForm(() => ({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n  onSubmit: ({ value }) => saveProfile(value),\n}))","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Svelte form API with typed field, subscription, and form-group\ncomponents attached."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nconst createForm: CreateForm;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/svelte-form/src/createForm.public.ts:53](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/svelte-form/src/createForm.public.ts#L53)\n\nCreates a Svelte form whose instance and lifecycle are owned by the current\ncomponent.\n\nPass an options function. `defaultValues` establish the initial state and\ninferred form value type, while reactive values read by the function update\nthe same form instance when they change.\n\nCall this during component initialization. The form mounts with the\ncomponent and is cleaned up when the component unmounts.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst form = createForm(() => ({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n  onSubmit: ({ value }) => saveProfile(value),\n}))\n```\n\n## Returns\n\nThe Svelte form API with typed field, subscription, and form-group\ncomponents attached.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: createForm\ntitle: createForm\n---\n\n```ts\nconst createForm: CreateForm;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/svelte-form/src/createForm.public.ts:53](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/svelte-form/src/createForm.public.ts#L53)\n\nCreates a Svelte form whose instance and lifecycle are owned by the current\ncomponent.\n\nPass an options function. `defaultValues` establish the initial state and\ninferred form value type, while reactive values read by the function update\nthe same form instance when they change.\n\nCall this during component initialization. The form mounts with the\ncomponent and is cleaned up when the component unmounts.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst form = createForm(() => ({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n  onSubmit: ({ value }) => saveProfile(value),\n}))\n```\n\n## Returns\n\nThe Svelte form API with typed field, subscription, and form-group\ncomponents attached.\n"}
